Z||000001||StuGood||09-14-2000||06:23 PM||||There have been many posts on engine conversions.  Might want to look at one that MooCow started a few weeks ago - some pretty good discussion on all the different options: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/005284.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/005284.html</A> <P>I gather that the  3.4 is the cheapest conversion - even cheaper than rebuilt 2.8.  Of course, as always, "your actual cost may vary."  But reading the thread might at least give you a few things to think about.      <BR><p>[This message has been edited by StuGood (edited 09-15-2000).]||||reg||1
